Description: network share discovery tool for SMB networks and domains
 sharefinder enumerates SMB shares, their read and write permissions and
 their files across networks and Active Directory domains. It finds shares
 open to null, guest or authenticated sessions, hunts domain computers
 through LDAP, and writes the results as text, JSONL, CSV, XML and an HTML
 report.
 .
 A port sweep runs before enumeration, a wrong password stops the scan
 after one rejected logon, and interrupted scans can be resumed.
